    <briefdescription>
<para>Short-rate dynamics in the extended Cox-Ingersoll-Ross model. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The short-rate is here <formula id="300">\[ r_t = \varphi(t) + y_t^2 \]</formula> where <formula id="294">$ \varphi(t) $</formula> is the deterministic time-dependent parameter used for term-structure fitting and <formula id="297">$ y_t $</formula> is the state variable, the square-root of a standard CIR process. </para>    </detaileddescription>
